<!--
  Status-bar icon for the capture notification.

  Notification small icons are drawn as a silhouette: Android throws away every
  colour and keeps only the alpha channel. So this is solid white on transparent
  and reads purely as shape — anything else appears as a white blob.

  The shape is the Relay mark reduced until it survives at 24dp: two lenses and
  the bridge, filled rather than stroked, because a 2dp stroke disappears in the
  status bar.
-->
